Bibit Runtime Plugin for Debian

This package installs the Runtime Feature bundle at
/usr/lib/bibit/plugins/runtime.bibit-plugin.tgz and the external-service
adapter as bibit-runtime-adapter@bianbu.service (127.0.0.1:5186).
The adapter connects to the separately installed Runtime at 127.0.0.1:9899.

Use a Bi-bit host that supports settings navigation sections and language
props. Restart the application after installation. Inspect the active Feature
version in Settings > Extensions; the Runtime management Plugins page manages
backend Runtime plugins, not Bibit Feature bundles.

Development instructions are included as plugin-development.md (possibly
compressed) in /usr/share/doc/bibit-runtime-plugin/. The source copy is
docs/plugin-development.md.
The bundled development public key is for internal development only; never
ship or commit the signing private key.
